.TH SHDEV 1.SH NAMEshdev \- show the device table.SH SYNOPSIS\fBshdev\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBshdev\fRlists the system's device table: each attached device with its filemanager, its driver and its capabilities, under the heading\fBDevice  Fmgr  Driver  Capabilities\fR.\fRUnder os9exec only the heading appears; on a real system it lists everydevice in use..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOdevs, getsys